TITLE Calcite kinetics at 200C, pH 2, Cu and Ba; compare totals at step 10
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Cu 10
    Ba 5
    Cl 25
    -water 1
KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT 1
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals C Cu
END
